    "Conditions do not start an alert. They are checked after a built-in or additional trigger fires and determine whether the alert continues. YAML and JSON are supported. For numeric_state, include at least one of above or below. Home Assistant's numeric_state condition does not support for; use a state condition when you need a duration.",
  ],
  "title": "Conditions",
}
`;

