    "Run this alert when Home Assistant starts.",
    "Re-evaluate the conditions on a repeating time pattern (default every 12 hours). Home Assistant aligns time patterns to the clock, so longer values are rounded to whole minutes or hours (up to 23), and 24 hours or more runs daily at midnight.",
